om/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T18:08:10Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T18:08:10Z","body":"caused by 7ab83282045b5031f07a6709d5f90af023ae8090 I'll make a revert commit. Since we're also reverting the other part of that fix nothing of value is lost\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4693985067/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694300485","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120228#issuecomment-4694300485","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120228","id":4694300485,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF81XRQ","user":{"login":"max99x","id":680351,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDM1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/680351?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x","html_url":"https://github.com/max99x","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T18:52:27Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T19:26:29Z","body":"> caused by 7ab8328 I'll make a revert commit.  Since we're also reverting the other part of that fix nothing of value is lost\n\nThanks for the quick fix! Since you're had a chance to use this project for a while to test against these resource loader issues, do you know what is it about the project in particular that causes it to hit all these bugs? Since I'm a month away from release, I'd rather change my loading code to have a guaranteed fallback in case the core fixes end up taking longer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694300485/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694514468","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120228#issuecomment-4694514468","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120228","id":4694514468,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF9CbJA","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T19:21:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T19:27:41Z","body":"> do you know what is it about the project in particular that causes it to hit all these bugs?\n\nI really wish I could tell you some byzantian tale of how your project is especially complex. But in this case the particular PRs that were just reverted were just completely ill-conceived. I made a mistake.\n\nFor the rest of your project, the main thing that's complex about your project is that you load things from custom resources in _load, this just causes a lot of dependencies and circular dependencies that \"build up\" later.\n\nThe best advice I can give you is to move as many instances of preload() in your gdscript to load() as pssible, that is where the most brittle code lies right now. Threaded loading in combination with preload() is iffy, you should really use either, not both for the foreseeable future\n\n@max99x I accidentally edit your prior comment, I restored it back to how it was. My apologies.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694514468/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694625527","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120228#issuecomment-4694625527","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120228","id":4694625527,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF9JM9w","user":{"login":"max99x","id":680351,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDM1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/680351?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x","html_url":"https://github.com/max99x","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T19:36:40Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T19:36:40Z","body":"@hpvb Thanks! The project uses almost no `preload()`s (just a couple of materials, leftover from ancient code). There are a few hundred `load()s`, but the vast majority of resources (thousands) all go through a single autoload script that sends out `ResourceLoader.load_threaded_request()`s in stages starting one frame after autoloads are initialized (doing it on the same frame causes all kinds of explosions). Although I explicitly cache/coalesce `load_threaded_request()` calls for the same resource, many of these calls end up being for resources that were loaded as dependencies earlier. I've never used subthreads because that has never worked for me, even though I'd love to get the speedup. There are no explicit circular dependencies as the editor wouldn't even allow it, but there are definitely implicit ones. Is there a safer way to approach it?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694625527/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694652400","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120228#issuecomment-4694652400","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120228","id":4694652400,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF9K18A","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T19:39:55Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T20:02:41Z","body":"> Is there a safer way to approach it?\n\nI think, if you don't have any preloads left now you're fine.. The current version of the resource loader should work fine with what you're doing.\n\nEdit: to clarify: the circular dependencies aren't necessarily in your resources. But because of the way the requests arrive at the loader the circular dependencies occur between resource loader threads. \n\nPreviously that was fatal, now that should just work! But not if you end up preloading Gdscript of any kind! That's still broken (and was broken in 4.6 as well)\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4694652400/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]